	(lib_symbols)
	(text "custom-wallet-min  --  ROOT sheet (Phase 02: design-complete only; NO fabrication before Phase 10)\n\nHierarchical schematic, five subsystem sheets: host / secure_elements / display / power_usb / expansion.\nESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 host + TROPIC01 (mandatory open vault) + OPTIGA Trust M 2nd-vendor key-split SE;\ndisplay-agnostic external SPI panel over FPC; USB-C (only signing transport in v1); battery-operable\n(BQ24074 + MAX17048 + MX1.25); gated expansion header + gated Qwiic port. ALL-SMD; no JavaCard/socket,\nno ISO 7816, no NFC, no camera. The Rust firmware signs (SE-as-safe, no in-SE signing on this board)."
